# A89 probe module order - INITIAL GUESS copied from the M8 port (same T157
# platform class). MUST be regenerated from the A89's own dump:
#   dumps/a89-stock/modules-load.txt (from /vendor/lib/modules/modules.load*)
# and cross-checked with modules.txt before the first probe run.
# Loading modules the A89 hardware does not have may fail probe rounds.
# Note: this file uses the .list extension because it is consumed verbatim as
# runtime data (one module per line); do not convert it to a watermarked
# document format.
